{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PS9gwSp68p3JA7hSeZV592","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 schema_semantic_constrained_ie 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (88 个)\\n\\n- **llama_scierc_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **llama_scierc_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_semantic_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_grammar_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_semantic_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **phase2_s2_pilot50**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_docred_schema**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_violation_rate_docred**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_scierc_schema**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_violation_rate**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-18\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| w9_qwen_docred_zs_sampling_r2 | Continuation of w9 DocRED sampling from doc 106, testing OntoCoDec full_s1 with temperature sampling (T=0.7) on remaining 892 DocRED documents | — | — | — |\\n| p8b_docred_latency | OntoCoDec constrained decoding overhead on Qwen3-8B DocRED (200-doc subset) measured on same GPU as P8 SciERC will confirm moderate overhead (<2x), providing consistent timing data for paper | — | — | — |\\n| 70b_docred_constrained | 70B AWQ-INT4 model with OntoCoDec constrained decoding on DocRED will achieve 0% ET/RV violations while maintaining F1, demonstrating cross-dataset scalability | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **w9_qwen_docred_zs_sampling** (failed): Temperature sampling (T=0.7, top_p=0.9) with OntoCoDec full_s1 on Qwen3-8B DocRED will maintain low violation rates while exploring