{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JEUUwufwKKnsSCmrx5CWmJ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<!-- memory.md — 非 metrics 性质的决策原因、约束、经验教训 -->\\\\n\\\\n## XGrammar Enum Automaton Bug — RE RV=0.03% Root Cause\\\\n\\\\n- 5/17341 violations in phase2_docred_full_s1 (xgrammar 0.1.33)\\\\n- All 5 from single doc \\\\\\\"Souvlaki\\\\\\\", chimeric relation \\\\\\\"membericipant of\\\\\\\" = token \\\\\\\"member\\\\\\\" + \\\\\\\"icipant\\\\\\\" + \\\\\\\" of\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Root cause: xgrammar byte-level enum automaton allows subword tokens from different enum entries to combine\\\\n- After \\\\\\\"member\\\\\\\", xgrammar allows 8 tokens when only \\\\\\\" of\\\\\\\"-continuing tokens should be valid\\\\n- TypeConstraintProcessor (Layer 2) doesn't catch this because RELATION_TYPE is fully delegated to xgrammar (Layer 1)\\\\n- Paper wording decision: Option B — \\\\\\\"a rare XGrammar automaton bug where subword tokens from different enum entries combine into chimeric values\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Full analysis: artifacts/r2n10_rv_root_cause.md\\\\n\\\\n## Q1 Zero Violations — Cross-Model Replication\\\\n\\\\n- Llama-3.1-8B LoRA FT + beam k=4 + full_s1 achieves ET=0%, RV=0%, DR=0%, CF=0% on SciERC (551 samples)\\\\n- Replicates w10_qwen_scierc_ft_beam_4 results on a second model\\\\n- Confirms zero violations is a property of OntoCoDec method, not model-specific\\\\n- Enables upgrading Abstract claim from single-model to two-model (D055)\\\\n- E_F1=67.94%, R_F1=46.11% (Llama) vs E_F1=62.17%, R_F1=52.35% (Qwen) — F1 trade-offs differ by model but violations identical\\\\n\\\\n## 70B SciERC Results Summary\\\\n\\\\n- 70B AWQ-INT4 (Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct-AWQ-INT4) on SciERC:\\\\n  - Unconstrained: ET=7.71%, RV=0.74%, DR=4.72%, E_F1=35.17%\\\\n  - Constrained (full_s1): ET=0%, RV=0%, DR=0%, E_F1=35.14%\\\\n- OntoCoDec eliminates all structural violations at 70B scale with zero F1 cost\\\\n- 70B model has much lower base F1 than 8B FT models (35% vs 62-68%) — expected for zero-shot on specialized IE\\\\n\\\\n## Beam Search Parameter Convention\\\\n\\\\n- Correct CLI: `--decoding_strategy beam --num_beams 4` (NOT `--beam_size 4`)\\\\n- Discovered via `--help` on run_constrained_extraction.py\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1877, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019KGHhiAJcq4YrCimzrvPb7","session_id":"0eddf8e3-65e4-4850-9e66-a5c0b106b0fa","uuid":"56070268-634a-4e90-a452-6ebe6bfb72eb","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:13:59.346Z"}
