with a principled solution. Two-layer architecture is sound, ablation thorough, and experimental coverage commendable. However, CF trade-off (up to 21% on EE), substantial residual DR on tighter ontologies (10.21% DocRED), gap between guarantee framing and actual behavior, and limited practical significance at low zero-shot F1 prevent a higher score. Solid engineering with useful conceptual contributions but falls short of a strong methodological advance.\n\n---\n\nYour response format:\n```\n## R2 Response to R1\n\n### Points of Agreement\n[numbered list]\n\n### Points of Disagreement\n[numbered list]\n\n### New Observations\n[any points R1 raised that you find particularly relevant or missed]\n\n### Updated Score: X/6 (previously 4/6)\n### Justification for change (or no change): [1-2 sentences]\n```\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017RpnbvZEF1ki1hwCUCMPLE","session_id":"0eddf8e3-65e4-4850-9e66-a5c0b106b0fa","uuid":"bc871fd5-8868-4ea9-81d0-b14fd1ecf7de","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:17:06.174Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NVbUaxHjdhzysHT1s12GfD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t% Section 7 — Discussion and Conclusion (maximally compressed)\n2\t% Full discussion in Appendix; Mistral boundary condition in app:dual-factor.\n3\t\n4\tOntoCoDec compiles IE ontology schemas into composable token-level decoding constraints that achieve 42--99\\% DR reduction across three models $\\times$ three datasets with no significant F1 cost.\n5\tComposed with LoRA fine-tuning, DR reaches $\\leq$\\,0.20\\% ($<$0.6\\,pp F1 cost); beam search ($k{=}4$) further eliminates both residual DR and CF for calibrated models (\\S\\ref{sec:beam-results}).\n6\tCF remains an open challenge for per-slot enforcement; global entity-level type consensus during decoding offers the most direct resolution path.\n7\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PMVKYmBqUBcXPnRtXNfp5a","session_id":"0eddf8e3-65e4-4850-9e66-a5c0b106b0fa","uuid":"b9a2c90c-09f8-46f4-8474-db9db1baaf96","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:17:06.061Z"}
